  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "394ae34d2755"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The current build-and-push-to-dockerhub.sh uses ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "read",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " to take a username and password from a prompt but within a GitHub action there is no prompt. This overrides the previously set DOCKER_USERNAME and DOCKER_PASSWORD environment variables. Place a check around read to see whether the variables are set before hand and use them rather than prompt the user in that case",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
