  "description": "<p>The current build-and-push-to-dockerhub.sh uses <tt>read</tt> to take a username and password from a prompt but within a GitHub action there is no prompt. This overrides the previously set DOCKER_USERNAME and DOCKER_PASSWORD environment variables. Place a check around read to see whether the variables are set before hand and use them rather than prompt the user in that case</p>",
